      "message": "I think this is correct. Looking at src/platform/ec/common/usbc/usb_pe_drp_sm.c, we don\u0027t currently process Get_Source_Cap_Extended so there shouldn\u0027t be any scenarios where we send Source_Capabilities_Extended.",
